  "answer": "#### Elements Drawn on Excalidraw\n\n- **Night Sky Canvas:** Large dark navy rectangle (`#0b132b`, 1120x630 px) covering the canvas, with solid fill.\n- **Rocket Nose Cone:** Red pointed cone (`#dc2626`) atop the rocket body, with solid fill.\n- **Rocket Body:** White rounded rocket fuselage (`#f8fafc`, 140x275 px), solid fill with rounded corners.\n- **Red Body Stripes:** Two horizontal red stripes (`#ef4444`) spanning the upper and lower sections of the rocket body, solid fill.\n- **Porthole Window:** Concentric circular window consisting of a dark blue outer rim (`#1e3a8a`), light blue glass center (`#7dd3fc`), and a specular highlight, all with solid fill.\n- **Side Fins:** Two triangular red fins (`#dc2626`), one mounted on each side of the body, solid fill.\n- **Engine Base & Nozzles:** Dark grey trapezoidal engine mount (`#374151`) and two medium grey rocket exhaust nozzles (`#6b7280`), solid fill.\n- **Exhaust Flames:** Layered thrust plume below the nozzles with a large orange outer flame (`#f97316`) and an inner yellow flame (`#fef08a`), solid fill.\n- **Stars:** Seven yellow 5-point stars (`#fef08a`) placed across the night sky around the rocket, solid fill.\n\n#### Limitations\n- None encountered. All requested shapes, positioning, colors, and solid fills rendered and verified via screenshot and scene graph inspection.",
